   "html": "<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n<title></title>\r\n<link href=\"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/noco-homeownership-plan\" rel=\"canonical\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"See your fastest path to homeownership in Northern Colorado. Compare grants, $0-down options, payment estimates, and personalized next steps. Quick, accurate, and local.\"><!-- Open Graph --><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Start Your Northern Colorado Homeownership Plan | 2026 Buyer Guide\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover your fastest path to homeownership in Northern Colorado. Grants, $0-down programs, and payment strategies built around YOU.\"><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/images/christine-gwinnup-social.jpg\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/noco-homeownership-plan\"><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"><!-- Twitter Card --><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Start Your Northern Colorado Homeownership Plan\"><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Your personalized roadmap to buying a home in Northern Colorado. Grants, payments, and next steps.\"><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/images/christine-gwinnup-social.jpg\"><!-- JSON-LD Schema: RealEstateAgent --><script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n  {\r\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n    \"@type\": \"RealEstateAgent\",\r\n    \"name\": \"Christine Gwinnup — The Little Lady Sells Homes\",\r\n    \"url\": \"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/noco-homeownership-plan\",\r\n    \"image\": \"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/images/christine-gwinnup-social.jpg\",\r\n    \"telephone\": \"303-709-4262\",\r\n    \"brand\": \"The Little Lady Sells Homes\",\r\n    \"areaServed\": [\r\n      \"Loveland CO\",\r\n      \"Fort Collins CO\",\r\n      \"Berthoud CO\",\r\n      \"Windsor CO\",\r\n      \"Greeley CO\",\r\n      \"Laporte CO\",\r\n      \"Masonville CO\",\r\n      \"Estes Park CO\"\r\n    ],\r\n    \"address\": {\r\n      \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\r\n      \"addressLocality\": \"Loveland\",\r\n      \"addressRegion\": \"CO\",\r\n      \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"sameAs\": [\r\n      \"https://www.youtube.com/@TheLittleLadySellsHomes\",\r\n      \"https://www.facebook.com/thelittleladysellshomes\",\r\n      \"https://www.instagram.com/thelittleladysellshomes\",\r\n      \"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com\"\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n  </script><!-- JSON-LD Schema: Breadcrumb --><script type=\"application/ld+json\">\r\n  {\r\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\r\n    \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\r\n    \"itemListElement\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\r\n        \"position\": 1,\r\n        \"name\": \"Home\",\r\n        \"item\": \"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"@type\": \"ListItem\",\r\n        \"position\": 2,\r\n        \"name\": \"Start Your NoCo Homeownership Plan\",\r\n        \"item\": \"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/noco-homeownership-plan\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n  </script><!-- KEYWORD CLUSTER (for your reference) --><!-- Primary: northern colorado homeownership plan, first time homebuyer northern colorado, grants colorado first time buyer, down payment assistance northern colorado --><!-- Secondary: first time homebuyer Loveland, Fort Collins, Windsor, Greeley, Berthoud, Masonville, Laporte --><!-- Long-Tail: how to buy a home in colorado with no money down, best no money down programs colorado -->\r\n<style type=\"text/css\">:root {\r\n      --brand: #8B0000;\r\n      --brand-dark: #6b0000;\r\n      --ink: #111827;\r\n      --muted: #6b7280;\r\n      --bg: #ffffff;\r\n      --bg-alt: #f9fafb;\r\n      --radius: 14px;\r\n      --shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(15,23,42,0.10);\r\n      --shadow-soft: 0 2px 10px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\r\n\r\n    body {\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\r\n      color: var(--ink);\r\n      background: var(--bg);\r\n      line-height: 1.6;\r\n      font-size: 16px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    a { color: var(--brand); text-decoration: none; }\r\n    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\r\n\r\n    .top-bar {\r\n      background: #111827;\r\n      color: #e5e7eb;\r\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      padding: 8px 16px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .container {\r\n      max-width: 1140px;\r\n      margin: 0 auto;\r\n      padding: 0 20px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    h1, h2, h3, h4 {\r\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      line-height: 1.2;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    h1 { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 3rem); }\r\n    h2 { font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.2rem); }\r\n    h3 { font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.6rem); }\r\n\r\n    p { margin: 0 0 14px; }\r\n\r\n    .hero {\r\n      padding: 60px 0 40px;\r\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(139,0,0,0.14), transparent 60%), #f3f4f6;\r\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .hero-inner {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      gap: 26px;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @media (min-width: 900px) {\r\n      .hero-inner {\r\n        grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .hero-kicker {\r\n      text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      letter-spacing: .12em;\r\n      font-size: 0.76rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .hero h1 span.highlight {\r\n      color: var(--brand);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .hero-sub {\r\n      font-size: 1.03rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n      max-width: 620px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .hero-cta {\r\n      margin-top: 20px;\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n      gap: 12px;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .btn {\r\n      display: inline-block;\r\n      border-radius: 999px;\r\n      padding: 12px 24px;\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n      font-size: 0.98rem;\r\n      cursor: pointer;\r\n      border: none;\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n      transition: all .2s ease;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .btn-primary {\r\n      background: var(--brand);\r\n      color: #fff;\r\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\r\n    }\r\n    .btn-primary:hover {\r\n      background: var(--brand-dark);\r\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\r\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(139,0,0,0.35);\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .btn-outline {\r\n      background: #fff;\r\n      color: var(--ink);\r\n      border: 1px solid #d1d5db;\r\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\r\n    }\r\n    .btn-outline:hover {\r\n      background: #f9fafb;\r\n      text-decoration: none;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .hero-note {\r\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n      margin-top: 8px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .hero-card {\r\n      background: #fff;\r\n      border-radius: 18px;\r\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\r\n      padding: 22px 20px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .hero-card h3 {\r\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .hero-card ul {\r\n      margin: 10px 0 0;\r\n      padding-left: 18px;\r\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .page-main {\r\n      padding: 50px 0 70px;\r\n      background: #ffffff;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .layout {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      gap: 32px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @media (min-width: 980px) {\r\n      .layout {\r\n        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2.1fr) minmax(280px, 1fr);\r\n        align-items: flex-start;\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .breadcrumb {\r\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .breadcrumb a { color: var(--muted); }\r\n    .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--brand); }\r\n\r\n    .section-block {\r\n      margin-bottom: 40px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .section-kicker {\r\n      text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      letter-spacing: 0.14em;\r\n      font-size: 0.74rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .section-lead {\r\n      font-size: 0.98rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n      max-width: 720px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pill-row {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n      gap: 8px;\r\n      margin-top: 8px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .pill {\r\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n      padding: 4px 10px;\r\n      border-radius: 999px;\r\n      background: #f3f4f6;\r\n      color: #374151;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .card-grid {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      gap: 18px;\r\n      margin-top: 18px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @media (min-width: 768px) {\r\n      .card-grid.cols-3 {\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n      }\r\n      .card-grid.cols-2 {\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .card {\r\n      background: #fff;\r\n      border-radius: 14px;\r\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\r\n      padding: 16px 16px 18px;\r\n      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\r\n      font-size: 0.94rem;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .card h3, .card h4 {\r\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n      font-size: 1rem;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .card p {\r\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .card ul {\r\n      margin: 8px 0 0;\r\n      padding-left: 18px;\r\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .step-list {\r\n      display: grid;\r\n      gap: 14px;\r\n      margin-top: 14px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @media (min-width: 768px) {\r\n      .step-list {\r\n        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .step {\r\n      background: #f9fafb;\r\n      border-radius: 12px;\r\n      padding: 14px 12px;\r\n      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\r\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .step-label {\r\n      font-size: 0.8rem;\r\n      text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .step strong {\r\n      display: block;\r\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .note-box {\r\n      background: #fffbeb;\r\n      border-radius: 12px;\r\n      padding: 14px 14px;\r\n      border: 1px solid #fbbf24;\r\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n      color: #92400e;\r\n      margin-top: 16px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .scenario-tag {\r\n      display: inline-block;\r\n      font-size: 0.74rem;\r\n      text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\r\n      color: #6b7280;\r\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .link-row {\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\r\n      gap: 10px;\r\n      margin-top: 12px;\r\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .link-chip {\r\n      display: inline-flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n      gap: 4px;\r\n      padding: 6px 10px;\r\n      border-radius: 999px;\r\n      background: #f3f4f6;\r\n      font-size: 0.86rem;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .link-chip span {\r\n      font-size: 1.1rem;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    /* Sidebar */\r\n    .sidebar-box {\r\n      padding: 20px 18px;\r\n      background: #fff;\r\n      border-radius: 16px;\r\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);\r\n      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\r\n      margin-bottom: 22px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .sidebar-box h3 {\r\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\r\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .sidebar-box p {\r\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .sidebar-meta {\r\n      font-size: 0.82rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n      margin-top: 8px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .sidebar-list {\r\n      margin: 6px 0 0;\r\n      padding-left: 18px;\r\n      font-size: 0.86rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .service-footer {\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      margin-top: 40px;\r\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\r\n      color: var(--muted);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @media (max-width: 767px) {\r\n      .hero {\r\n        padding-top: 40px;\r\n      }\r\n      .hero-cta {\r\n        flex-direction: column;\r\n        align-items: flex-start;\r\n      }\r\n      .hero-cta .btn {\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n</style>\r\n<div class=\"top-bar\">2026 Northern Colorado Homeownership: Smart planning beats trying to time the market.</div>\r\n<!-- HERO -->\r\n\r\n<header class=\"hero\">\r\n<div class=\"container hero-inner\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"hero-kicker\">NoCo Buyers &bull; First-Time &amp; Move-Up</div>\r\n\r\n<h1>Start Your <span class=\"highlight\">Northern Colorado Homeownership Plan</span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"hero-sub\">Whether you&rsquo;re renting, thinking about selling, or relocating to Northern Colorado, this page is your starting point. We&rsquo;ll map out grants, $0-down options, timing, and realistic payments&mdash;built around your life, not a generic script.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hero-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/first-time-buyer-quick-check\">&#128640; Take the 60-Second Quick Check </a> <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"https://calendly.com/thelittleladysellshomes/30min\"> &#128172; Talk Through My Options With Christine </a></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"hero-note\">No obligation. No pressure. Just straight answers about numbers, timing, and next steps.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<aside class=\"hero-card\">\r\n<h3>What You&rsquo;ll Walk Away With</h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>A realistic timeframe: &ldquo;0&ndash;3 months&rdquo;, &ldquo;3&ndash;6 months&rdquo;, or &ldquo;6&ndash;12+ months&rdquo;.</li>\r\n\t<li>Whether grants / $0-down programs are likely in your situation.</li>\r\n\t<li>A ballpark payment range based on today&rsquo;s market, not last year&rsquo;s news.</li>\r\n\t<li>Clear options for: stay put, buy, or bridge with rent-to-own style tools.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</aside>\r\n</div>\r\n</header>\r\n<!-- MAIN CONTENT -->\r\n\r\n<main class=\"page-main\">\r\n<div class=\"container layout\"><!-- MAIN COLUMN -->\r\n<article>\r\n<nav class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a> &raquo; Start Your NoCo Homeownership Plan</nav>\r\n<!-- Section 1: Where should you start? -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"section-block\">\r\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Step 1</div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Pick Your Starting Point (So We Don&rsquo;t Waste Time)</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"section-lead\">You don&rsquo;t need a 40-page seminar to get moving. You need a clear, honest snapshot: <strong>Where am I today&mdash;and what&rsquo;s the smartest next move?</strong> That&rsquo;s what this plan does.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-grid cols-3\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"scenario-tag\">Path A &bull; Renting</div>\r\n\r\n<h3>&ldquo;I&rsquo;m Renting &amp; Ready to See What&rsquo;s Possible&rdquo;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Perfect if you&rsquo;re paying strong rent and wondering if you could own instead&mdash;without draining your savings.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Check $0-down and grant options.</li>\r\n\t<li>See a realistic price band in today&rsquo;s market.</li>\r\n\t<li>Compare buying vs staying put for another year.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"scenario-tag\">Path B &bull; Already Own</div>\r\n\r\n<h3>&ldquo;I Own&mdash;but the House No Longer Fits Me&rdquo;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Ideal if you&rsquo;re thinking of selling and buying again&mdash;downsizing, upsizing, or shifting towns within NoCo.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Explore selling with strategy (not panic).</li>\r\n\t<li>See what your equity can actually do.</li>\r\n\t<li>Look at downsize options, low-maintenance living, or acreage.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"scenario-tag\">Path C &bull; Relocating</div>\r\n\r\n<h3>&ldquo;I&rsquo;m Relocating to Northern Colorado&rdquo;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Best if you&rsquo;re moving for work, lifestyle, or family and want a clean, honest read on towns, prices, and timing.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Compare Loveland, Windsor, Greeley, Berthoud &amp; more.</li>\r\n\t<li>Get realistic commute + lifestyle options.</li>\r\n\t<li>Build a plan that doesn&rsquo;t derail your move.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"note-box\">This isn&rsquo;t a generic &ldquo;lead funnel.&rdquo; I&rsquo;ve helped hundreds of Northern Colorado buyers through real timelines, real fears, and real market shifts. The goal here is for you to feel <strong>informed, not sold.</strong></div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Section 2: How your plan works -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"section-block\">\r\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Step 2</div>\r\n\r\n<h2>How Your Northern Colorado Homeownership Plan Works</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"section-lead\">You can start in two ways: my <a href=\"/first-time-buyer-quick-check\">60-Second Quick Check</a> (for fast answers) or a <a href=\"https://calendly.com/thelittleladysellshomes/30min\">30-minute planning call</a> if you prefer to talk it out.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"step-list\">\r\n<div class=\"step\">\r\n<div class=\"step-label\">Step 1</div>\r\n<strong>Share Where You&rsquo;re At</strong> <span>Quick questions about timing, comfort level, and what&rsquo;s holding you back&mdash;down payment, credit, or just clarity.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"step\">\r\n<div class=\"step-label\">Step 2</div>\r\n<strong>I Map Your Options</strong> <span>I layer in DPA programs, $0-down options, current inventory, and payment scenarios based on your goals.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"step\">\r\n<div class=\"step-label\">Step 3</div>\r\n<strong>We Decide Together</strong> <span>We decide whether this is a &ldquo;move now,&rdquo; &ldquo;prep for a few months,&rdquo; or &ldquo;build a 6&ndash;12 month game plan&rdquo; situation.</span></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"step\">\r\n<div class=\"step-label\">Step 4</div>\r\n<strong>Next Steps You Can Actually Use</strong> <span>That might be lender intros, a neighborhood short list, a downsizing plan, or a rent-to-own bridge comparison.</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"link-row\"><a class=\"link-chip\" href=\"/first-time-buyer-quick-check\"><span>&#128640;</span> Take the First-Time Buyer Quick Check </a> <a class=\"link-chip\" href=\"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/noco-fthb-dpa-programs\"> <span>&#128216;</span> Read: NoCo DPA &amp; First-Time Buyer Guide </a> <a class=\"link-chip\" href=\"/my-active-listings\"> <span>&#127969;</span> Browse Current Northern Colorado Listings </a></div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Section 3: NoCo-specific advantages -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"section-block\">\r\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Step 3</div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Use the Advantages That Are Unique to Northern Colorado</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"section-lead\">Our market is different than Denver or the coasts. There are specific zip codes, pockets, and price bands where first-time and move-up buyers quietly win&mdash;if they know where to look.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-grid cols-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<h3>Grants &amp; Assistance (Beyond Google)</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>I track which <strong>Down Payment Assistance (DPA)</strong> and grant options are actually closing here&mdash;CHFA and beyond. Not everything you read online is practical in Larimer &amp; Weld Counties.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>See which programs match your credit + income band.</li>\r\n\t<li>Understand where $0-down is realistic vs misleading.</li>\r\n\t<li>Know which neighborhoods stretch your budget further.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:8px;font-size:0.9rem;\">&#128073; Dive deeper: <a href=\"https://www.thelittleladysellshomes.com/noco-fthb-dpa-programs\">NoCo First-Time Buyer &amp; DPA Guide</a>.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<h3>Neighborhoods That Fit Your Season of Life</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>From downtown Loveland bungalows to quieter streets in Eaton or Windsor, the goal isn&rsquo;t &ldquo;any house&rdquo;&mdash;it&rsquo;s the right daily life.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Walkable vs quiet cul-de-sacs vs acreage.</li>\r\n\t<li>Commute, schools, and weekend lifestyle reality.</li>\r\n\t<li>Where your monthly payment lines up with your sanity.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Section 4: Example paths -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"section-block\">\r\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Examples</div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Realistic Example Paths for NoCo Buyers</h2>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-grid cols-3\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"scenario-tag\">Track A &bull; 0&ndash;3 Months</div>\r\n\r\n<h4>&ldquo;We&rsquo;re Ready If the Numbers Work&rdquo;</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>You complete the Quick Check. Your credit and income look strong, and you&rsquo;re flexible on town/neighborhood.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>We confirm DPA / grant eligibility.</li>\r\n\t<li>You get introduced to a local lender who works quickly.</li>\r\n\t<li>Within a few weeks, you&rsquo;re touring in 1&ndash;3 target areas.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"scenario-tag\">Track B &bull; 3&ndash;9 Months</div>\r\n\r\n<h4>&ldquo;We Need a Short Prep Window&rdquo;</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Maybe credit needs a bump or you need a few months of job history. That doesn&rsquo;t mean you&rsquo;re stuck renting forever.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>We build a simple 90&ndash;180 day plan.</li>\r\n\t<li>You get lender guidance on what moves the needle.</li>\r\n\t<li>We watch a short list of homes so you see real progress.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"scenario-tag\">Track C &bull; 6&ndash;12+ Months</div>\r\n\r\n<h4>&ldquo;We&rsquo;re Planning a Bigger Life Shift&rdquo;</h4>\r\n\r\n<p>Big relocation, downsizing from a long-term home, or waiting on a life event? You still benefit from a plan now.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>We clarify what you&rsquo;re moving <em>toward</em>, not just away from.</li>\r\n\t<li>You see what your current home could do for you.</li>\r\n\t<li>We build a calm, smart timing window instead of a scramble.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n<!-- Section 5: Next steps CTA -->\r\n\r\n<section class=\"section-block\">\r\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Next Steps</div>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ready to See Your NoCo Plan on Paper?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"section-lead\">You don&rsquo;t have to &ldquo;be ready&rdquo; to talk to a Realtor. You just have to be curious about what&rsquo;s possible.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"link-row\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"&lt;a%20class=\" btn>\r\n    Start My Quick Check &rarr;\r\n</a>\r\n\" target=\"notSet\"&gt;Start With the 60-Second Quick Check  <a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"https://calendly.com/thelittleladysellshomes/30min\"> Schedule a 30-Minute Planning Call </a></div>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px;\">Not a first-time buyer? We can still use this same framework to help you downsize, upsize, or relocate.</p>\r\n</section>\r\n</article>\r\n<!-- SIDEBAR -->\r\n\r\n<aside><!-- Sidebar Box #1 -->\r\n<div class=\"sidebar-box\">\r\n<h3>Start Your NoCo Homeownership Plan</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>See grants, $0-down options, and payment estimates personalized to you.</p>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/noco-homeownership-plan\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center;\" target=\"notSet\">&#128640; Take the 60-Second Quick Check </a>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"sidebar-meta\">Fast, secure, and reviewed personally by Christine &mdash; not a random bot.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Sidebar Box #2 -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"sidebar-box\">\r\n<h3>Talk With Christine</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Prefer a real conversation? We&rsquo;ll walk through your exact situation and pick a smart path.</p>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"https://calendly.com/thelittleladysellshomes/30min\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center;\">&#128172; Book a 30-Min Planning Call </a>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"sidebar-list\">\r\n\t<li>Zoom or phone, your choice.</li>\r\n\t<li>No pressure to buy or sell right now.</li>\r\n\t<li>Clear next steps in writing after our call.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- Sidebar Box #3 -->\r\n\r\n<div class=\"sidebar-box\">\r\n<h3>Explore Northern Colorado Homes</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Curious what&rsquo;s actually on the market in your price range?</p>\r\n<a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"/my-active-listings\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center;\">&#127969; View Active Listings </a>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"sidebar-meta\">From Loveland and Fort Collins to Windsor, Greeley, Berthoud, and beyond.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</aside>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"service-footer\">Serving Northern Colorado homebuyers in Loveland, Fort Collins, Windsor, Greeley, Berthoud, Timnath, Laporte, Masonville, and Estes Park.<br>\r\nQuestions right now? Call or text <a href=\"tel:3037094262\">303-709-4262</a>.</div>\r\n</main>\r\n\n"
  }
